  <header>
    <h1>Mr X Thakur</h1>
    <p>Ek aam ladke ki kahani – jo sapne dekhta hai, par unhe jeene ke liye sangharsh karta hai.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>1. Parichay</h2>
    <p><span class="highlight">Mr X Thakur</span> ek aisa ladka hai jiska jeevan ek chhoti si basti se shuru hota hai, lekin
      uske sapne duniya se bade hain. Usne kabhi aish-o-aram nahi dekha, par kabhi haar bhi nahi maani.
      Ye kahani hai ek aise insaan ki jo khud mein shaant hai, par andar se tufaan hai.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>2. Duniya aur Parivaar</h2>
    <p>Uska janam ek <span class="highlight">gareeb parivaar</span> mein hua. Bachpan se hi sidha-saadha ladka tha —
      na demand, na doston ka jhund. Maa ghar ke kaam ke liye bahar jaati thi, aur Mr X ghar sambhalta tha —
      chhote bhai-behno ka khayal, khana banana, sab kuch apne kandhon par uthaya.</p>

    <p>Jab wo sirf <span class="highlight">10 saal</span> ka tha, tab wo akela gaon se bhaag kar
      Punjab ke <span class="highlight">Hoshiarpur</span> aa gaya — kaam ki talaash mein.
      Wahin usne kaam ke saath apni padhai bhi puri ki. Ek aisa bachcha jise duniya ne mushkil di, par himmat bhi di.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>3. Vartamaan Jeevan aur Pesha</h2>
    <p>Aaj ke samay mein Mr X Thakur ek <span class="highlight">caretaker</span> ke roop mein kaam karta hai —
      ek aunty ki dekhbhal karta hai jinko <span class="highlight">dementia</span> hai.
      Uska kaam mushkil hai, par wo dil se karta hai.</p>

    <p>Par kahani yahin nahi rukti — andar hi andar wo khud bhi
      <span class="highlight">depression</span> se lad raha hai. Uske sapne hain, lekin un tak pahunchne ke raste
      uske khayalon ke dhund mein kho jaate hain.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>4. Vyaktitva (Personality)</h2>
    <p>Mr X ek <span class="highlight">calm aur introverted</span> vyakti hai.
      Use bheed pasand nahi, shor se dur rehna acha lagta hai.
      Uske liye khud ke sath waqt bitana ek therapy hai. Wo zyada bolta nahi,
      par jab kuch kehta hai to seedha dil tak chhoo jaata hai.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>5. Sapne aur Lakshya</h2>
    <div class="goal-box">
      "Apne looks ko behtar banana, height badhana, aur samaj mein acceptance paana —
      ye uske personal goals hain. Na koi khas talent, na extraordinary appearance,
      par ek jazba hai — khud ko sudharne ka."
    </div>

    <p>Mr X Thakur ka maanna hai ki duniya tab tak aapko accept nahi karti jab tak aap
      khud ko accept nahi karte. Aur yehi uska jeevan mantra hai.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>6. Antim Sandesh</h2>
    <p>Har insaan ke andar ek kahani hoti hai jo duniya nahi jaanti.
      Mr X Thakur ki kahani bhi unhi anjaani kahaniyon mein se ek hai —
      jahan struggle hai, tanhai hai, par umeed bhi hai.</p>
    <p>Agar aapne kabhi apne sapnon se haar nahi maani, to aap bhi Mr X Thakur ke jaise ho.</p>

